# Final Principle

A devastating uppercut does not begin with the fist.

It begins with the feet,

accelerates through the legs,

extends through the hips,

travels across the trunk,

and is finally delivered through the arm.

The Cable Uppercut strengthens this entire kinetic chain,

transforming explosive intent into effective striking power.